
//SwiftPurse\frontend\user\add-funds.html
when the payment method of Institutional  Transfer is clicked  the Institutional  Transfer card appears and replaces all the page content but if the payment method of crypto deposit the crypto deposit card appears and replaces all the page content
-in the navbar of this page at the profile image section when clicked the sub nav profile image there should be populated with dynamic content 

//Institutional  Transfer
in this card all the user dynamic indicated details in the card should be displayed 
-the Swift Code, Routing Number values should be left as it is  


//crypto deposit
-in this card when the form is filled and subimtted successfully it redirect to same page card and  displays payment pending 
-user recieves this notification below in it's dashboard notifications page
Title: Deposit Submitted
Message: Your deposit of $50(dynamic based on amount)is under review 
Time: 21 hours ago(dynamic)
icon: bell icon 
link named view details leads to the  /user/notifications.html page where all history are displayed 

and this message notifcation should also be pushed to user screen using this dynamic snipt of code according to the event that occurred

